WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:03:08.370
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
03:08.640 --> 03:10.520
Where is that shameless daughter-in-law?

3
03:10.600 --> 03:13.640
I think Hathai might be sleeping with Dech.

4
03:13.720 --> 03:17.200
Both of my sons died because of you.

5
03:17.280 --> 03:18.960
PREVIOUSLY

6
03:19.040 --> 03:22.080
Hathaya, please find the money to pay off my debt.

7
03:22.160 --> 03:24.080
Where am I supposed to get that kind of money?

8
03:24.680 --> 03:25.960
Go see your father. Go see Grandpa.

9
03:26.040 --> 03:29.560
Bring back the money so we can pay for Grandma's treatment.

10
03:33.720 --> 03:35.000
Have we met before?

11
03:36.400 --> 03:37.520
Grandpa.

12
03:39.600 --> 03:40.800
My name is Hathaya.

13
03:50.560 --> 03:51.920
I missed you so much, Grandpa.

14
03:52.000 --> 03:54.120
I love you more than anyone in the world.

15
04:01.360 --> 04:02.640
You're not my granddaughter.

16
04:10.240 --> 04:12.480
I'm Hathaya, Grandpa.

17
04:13.160 --> 04:14.880
I'm your granddaughter.

18
04:15.640 --> 04:19.200
My granddaughter died along with that wicked mother of hers.

19
04:20.120 --> 04:21.320
They're both dead to me.

20
04:27.080 --> 04:29.720
I know what my mom did,

21
04:30.520 --> 04:32.880
and I know how angry you are with her.

22
04:34.000 --> 04:35.520
But I wanted to come back to you.

23
04:37.600 --> 04:39.080
You wanted to come back to me,

24
04:39.960 --> 04:42.840
yet you let more than ten years go by?

25
04:44.360 --> 04:46.280
Mom wouldn't let me come here.

26
04:46.920 --> 04:49.640
She told me this house had burned down

27
04:49.720 --> 04:51.120
and everyone who lived here

28
04:52.040 --> 04:53.680
had died.

29
04:54.640 --> 04:56.280
Your mother is evil.

30
04:56.360 --> 04:58.320
She practically cursed me to my grave.

31
05:02.280 --> 05:04.160
That cruelty is simply in her nature.

32
05:08.400 --> 05:11.520
Please let me apologize on behalf of her, Grandpa.

33
05:13.000 --> 05:15.200
I only just found out the truth myself.

34
05:15.280 --> 05:16.960
Once I learned that everyone was still here,

35
05:17.640 --> 05:19.200
I rushed back

36
05:19.720 --> 05:21.600
because I missed you.

37
05:21.680 --> 05:22.920
I missed Dad too.

38
05:23.840 --> 05:25.560
Where is my dad?

39
05:36.320 --> 05:39.640
Aunt Liu, where is my dad?

40
05:41.440 --> 05:42.760
Your dad is dead.

41
05:46.360 --> 05:49.240
Back then, Burapha and my husband

42
05:49.320 --> 05:52.320
went after you to bring you back. They got into an accident.

43
05:53.760 --> 05:55.840
They died because of you.

44
06:01.360 --> 06:03.560
I'm sorry, Aunt Liu.

45
06:05.040 --> 06:08.040
Chaya, I'm sorry.

46
06:12.800 --> 06:15.280
I lost both of my sons.

47
06:16.720 --> 06:19.640
Do you have any idea how much I lost?

48
06:22.000 --> 06:24.000
Do you know how long it took us

49
06:25.480 --> 06:27.520
to put those horrible memories behind us?

50
06:31.000 --> 06:32.040
And then suddenly

51
06:32.720 --> 06:34.440
you show up on what was supposed to be

52
06:34.520 --> 06:36.920
one of the happiest days of my life.

53
06:38.320 --> 06:41.360
You're just as terrible as your mother. You're selfish!

54
06:45.960 --> 06:48.080
Ever since the day you two left this house,

55
06:49.160 --> 06:51.080
we considered you dead.

56
06:57.760 --> 06:59.200
So consider us dead too.

57
06:59.840 --> 07:02.080
In this life or the next, I never want to see you.

58
07:06.240 --> 07:08.720
Whatever debt we had to each other ends here.

59
07:11.120 --> 07:13.400
Get out. Get out!

60
07:17.720 --> 07:20.680
I know how much everyone has suffered.

61
07:22.120 --> 07:24.000
But I want you to know

62
07:24.520 --> 07:27.600
that I've suffered just as much as you have, Grandpa.

63
07:29.240 --> 07:31.640
Back then, all I could do was cry for you.

64
07:32.840 --> 07:34.400
I wanted to come home.

65
07:37.120 --> 07:38.680
But I was only a child.

66
07:39.520 --> 07:41.200
There was nothing I could do.

67
07:44.520 --> 07:46.440
You hate my mother.

68
07:47.720 --> 07:49.400
But am I also to blame

69
07:50.240 --> 07:52.440
just because I'm her daughter?

70
07:56.600 --> 07:58.040
Grandpa,

71
07:58.560 --> 08:01.440
no one chooses to be born into a broken family.

72
08:02.280 --> 08:05.240
And no one wants to have a bad mother.

73
08:10.880 --> 08:14.120
If you don't want me, that's okay.

74
08:14.840 --> 08:15.920
I'll leave.

75
08:17.560 --> 08:19.760
But I want you to know that

76
08:20.280 --> 08:22.880
no matter how much time passes,

77
08:24.080 --> 08:26.040
I will always love you.

78
08:27.360 --> 08:29.760
And I will always be your granddaughter.

79
08:50.080 --> 08:51.200
Father!

80
08:51.280 --> 08:52.800
-Grandpa! -Father!

81
08:52.880 --> 08:54.760
Father!

82
08:54.840 --> 08:56.400
-Call an ambulance. -Grandpa!

83
08:58.720 --> 08:59.600
Oh, Father.

84
09:09.840 --> 09:12.400
Wait. I think you should go home.

85
09:13.560 --> 09:15.000
Please let me see Grandpa.

86
09:16.280 --> 09:17.240
Hey.

87
09:17.760 --> 09:19.440
I'm warning you because I mean well.

88
09:19.960 --> 09:22.720
Ms. Liu is furious with you. She doesn't want to see you.

89
09:23.800 --> 09:26.240
Please let me visit Grandpa.

90
09:26.760 --> 09:29.280
I just want to see him. If Grandpa is okay,

91
09:29.360 --> 09:30.800
I won't bother them again.

92
09:31.800 --> 09:33.960
Please. I'm really worried about him.

93
09:34.040 --> 09:36.360
Please. Can I?

94
09:37.960 --> 09:38.880
Please.

95
09:46.960 --> 09:48.440
Go home!

96
09:53.760 --> 09:54.960
Aunt Liu,

97
09:55.480 --> 09:57.520
I'm really worried about Grandpa.

98
09:58.720 --> 09:59.920
Listen to me.

99
10:00.680 --> 10:03.320
Before this, Father was healthy

100
10:03.400 --> 10:04.640
and happy.

101
10:04.720 --> 10:06.520
But the moment you came into this house,

102
10:06.600 --> 10:09.040
everything went wrong.

103
10:09.120 --> 10:11.200
You only bring bad luck, just like your mother.

104
10:13.440 --> 10:16.200
Father used to say your mother

105
10:16.280 --> 10:17.640
was a parasite

106
10:17.720 --> 10:20.280
who latched onto him and sucked him dry.

107
10:20.360 --> 10:21.720
And he was right.

108
10:21.800 --> 10:25.320
Your mother stole his money and my jewelry.

109
10:25.840 --> 10:29.440
And now that she's lost everything,

110
10:29.520 --> 10:32.400
she sends you back here to be another low-class parasite,

111
10:32.480 --> 10:35.360
clinging to us and sucking away our blood and money.

112
10:35.440 --> 10:37.400
Tell me. Am I wrong?

113
10:49.800 --> 10:53.760
I know you love Grandpa, Hathaya,

114
10:54.360 --> 10:56.760
and I understand how you feel.

115
11:03.080 --> 11:04.680
But your mother

116
11:06.280 --> 11:08.360
hurt Grandpa deeply.

117
11:08.440 --> 11:10.760
She disappointed him and caused him so much pain.

118
11:11.360 --> 11:13.120
And now Grandpa is sick too.

119
11:13.800 --> 11:15.400
I'm worried about his feelings.

120
11:22.880 --> 11:24.800
You say you love Grandpa.

121
11:25.720 --> 11:28.400
Then give him what he wants.

122
11:29.440 --> 11:31.320
Get out of his life.

123
11:31.840 --> 11:35.000
Consider it your birthday gift to him.

124
11:42.280 --> 11:43.280
Alright.

125
11:44.000 --> 11:45.280
I'll go.

126
11:47.280 --> 11:48.960
But Aunt Liu,

127
11:49.040 --> 11:51.320
could you please tell Grandpa something for me?

128
11:55.400 --> 11:56.600
Tell him that I love him

129
11:57.840 --> 12:00.160
and that I've always missed him.

130
12:16.720 --> 12:18.680
Doctor, how is my grandfather?

131
12:27.640 --> 12:30.160
Hey, wait.

132
12:37.760 --> 12:38.920
The housekeeper knew

133
12:40.360 --> 12:41.840
you were coming to the hospital,

134
12:42.360 --> 12:44.680
so she brought your suitcase here for you.

135
12:45.640 --> 12:46.640
Here.

136
12:49.400 --> 12:50.560
Thank you.

137
12:52.040 --> 12:53.680
Where are you going?

138
13:00.800 --> 13:02.640
I came here

139
13:03.520 --> 13:06.800
because I love my grandpa and missed him.

140
13:09.880 --> 13:11.240
But unfortunately,

141
13:12.800 --> 13:14.680
my dad is gone.

142
13:16.760 --> 13:19.800
And Grandpa hates me and is furious with me.

143
13:22.320 --> 13:24.080
So I'll go back to where I belong.

144
13:28.280 --> 13:30.000
Thank you

145
13:30.720 --> 13:32.920
for being kind to a parasite like me.

146
13:34.320 --> 13:35.840
I'm only one of his workers.

147
13:36.680 --> 13:37.920
I'm an outsider,

148
13:39.320 --> 13:41.120
so I can't meddle in your family.

149
13:43.800 --> 13:45.680
But as his granddaughter,

150
13:47.400 --> 13:48.560
you have the right to know

151
13:49.600 --> 13:51.320
what illness he has.

152
13:53.560 --> 13:54.800
What's wrong with Grandpa?

153
13:55.920 --> 13:57.440
Is it serious?

154
14:10.560 --> 14:12.720
Careful, Grandpa.

155
14:15.480 --> 14:18.640
I'm still strong. I can walk just fine. Don't worry.

156
14:19.680 --> 14:20.840
Father,

157
14:20.920 --> 14:24.280
a stroke can be very dangerous.

158
14:24.360 --> 14:26.000
The doctor specifically told us

159
14:26.080 --> 14:28.720
that you need to be watched very carefully.

160
14:28.800 --> 14:29.800
That's right.

161
14:29.880 --> 14:32.440
If your arms or legs suddenly become weak

162
14:32.520 --> 14:36.040
and you fall and hit your head, it could be very dangerous.

163
14:36.120 --> 14:40.440
The MRI results just came back. They said the narrowing is only minor.

164
14:40.520 --> 14:42.200
It's nothing serious.

165
14:42.280 --> 14:44.760
Besides, you just wished for me to stay strong.

166
14:44.840 --> 14:46.560
Your wish is already

167
14:46.640 --> 14:48.400
working for me. See?

168
14:49.760 --> 14:50.960
Mom and I

169
14:51.040 --> 14:52.960
will take the best care of you, Grandpa.

170
14:53.040 --> 14:54.720
Alright, dear.

171
14:58.960 --> 15:01.760
Father, are you looking for someone?

172
15:02.360 --> 15:04.160
That woman went back already, didn't she?

173
15:06.360 --> 15:10.840
You can always tell whether someone truly loves you when you're sick.

174
15:10.920 --> 15:13.360
If Hathaya really loved you,

175
15:13.440 --> 15:15.880
she would've stayed by your side at the hospital.

176
15:15.960 --> 15:18.040
But what did she do?

177
15:18.120 --> 15:22.080
The moment she saw you collapse, she grabbed her suitcase and ran away.

178
15:23.240 --> 15:24.680
Good. It's better that she left.

179
15:25.960 --> 15:27.880
Make sure everyone knows

180
15:27.960 --> 15:30.040
not to let her set foot in this house again.

181
15:31.040 --> 15:32.680
Of course, Father.

182
15:34.360 --> 15:36.760
Get out! I told you that you can't come in!

183
15:36.840 --> 15:39.040
I said you can't come in!

184
15:39.120 --> 15:40.240
Oh.

185
15:42.480 --> 15:44.440
-What is this? -Hello, Grandpa.

186
15:48.200 --> 15:50.640
Hello, Aunt Liu. Hi, Chayanee.

187
15:52.480 --> 15:54.440
Why are you back? You said you were leaving.

188
15:54.520 --> 15:56.800
I heard Grandpa is sick and needs someone to care for him.

189
15:56.880 --> 16:00.160
So I packed my things and came back to live here.

190
16:00.880 --> 16:03.280
Stay out of my business. You're not a nurse.

191
16:04.160 --> 16:05.840
I didn't graduate from nursing school,

192
16:05.920 --> 16:08.480
but my maternal grandpa had the same condition as you.

193
16:08.560 --> 16:11.360
I know how to take care of someone after a stroke.

194
16:11.440 --> 16:14.720
Then where is your other grandpa? Go take care of him.

195
16:14.800 --> 16:15.960
He passed away.

196
16:16.480 --> 16:18.160
But he died in an accident.

197
16:18.240 --> 16:20.240
Stay out of my business.

198
16:21.120 --> 16:22.600
Take your bags and leave.

199
16:23.560 --> 16:24.640
I've never had

200
16:24.720 --> 16:28.000
the chance to repay you for everything you did for me.

201
16:28.080 --> 16:31.560
Please let me use this opportunity to make up for all the years we lost.

202
16:32.880 --> 16:34.160
You really are stubborn.

203
16:34.240 --> 16:35.600
If you refuse to listen,

204
16:35.680 --> 16:39.200
I'll call the police and have them drag you out of here.

205
16:39.280 --> 16:42.080
Aunt Liu, I'm Grandpa's own flesh and blood.

206
16:42.160 --> 16:43.640
Please let me stay here

207
16:43.720 --> 16:45.880
so I can repay you both for everything you've done.

208
16:47.920 --> 16:50.440
What do you really want by coming back here?

209
16:51.920 --> 16:54.840
Your mother is out of options, so she sent you back, right?

210
16:57.400 --> 16:58.240
Yes.

211
17:00.320 --> 17:02.560
See, Father? I knew it.

212
17:02.640 --> 17:04.480
Her mother sent her back here

213
17:04.560 --> 17:07.119
to suck you dry again.

214
17:10.720 --> 17:13.839
I admit that I'm in trouble, Grandpa.

215
17:14.640 --> 17:16.319
I need one million baht.

216
17:16.400 --> 17:18.520
Mom owes money to illegal lenders.

217
17:20.240 --> 17:22.720
If we don't pay them, they're going to kill her.

218
17:23.440 --> 17:24.960
And my grandma is seriously ill.

219
17:25.480 --> 17:27.800
I need money for her treatment too.

220
17:30.480 --> 17:32.440
How pathetic.

221
17:32.520 --> 17:35.960
So your true colors finally come out. You came because you're desperate for money.

222
17:36.560 --> 17:38.800
But fine, since we're family,

223
17:38.880 --> 17:42.840
I'll give you money for the trip home. Then never set foot here again.

224
17:43.480 --> 17:45.280
-Chamoi. -Yes, ma'am?

225
17:45.360 --> 17:46.280
Drag her bags outside.

226
17:46.360 --> 17:48.120
Yes, ma'am.

227
17:48.200 --> 17:49.800
Please don't, Aunt Chamoi. No!

228
17:49.880 --> 17:51.040
Don't take my things.

229
17:51.120 --> 17:52.920
No, please!

230
17:53.000 --> 17:54.360
Stop.

231
17:55.680 --> 17:58.760
Father, don't give in to her.

232
18:03.960 --> 18:05.320
I have an offer for you.

233
18:08.640 --> 18:10.160
You said you need money.

234
18:10.880 --> 18:12.240
Then I'll hire you to work.

235
18:16.880 --> 18:19.600
I'll give you 500,000 baht now.

236
18:21.640 --> 18:25.200
Work for me for one month, and I'll give you another 500,000.

237
18:30.440 --> 18:33.520
Or there's another offer. An even better one.

238
18:35.800 --> 18:38.400
Take ten million baht and never set foot here again.

239
18:48.680 --> 18:49.720
Grandpa,

240
18:50.840 --> 18:53.920
I am in trouble. And I do need the money.

241
18:58.520 --> 19:01.200
But I will not walk out of your life.

242
19:04.520 --> 19:06.600
I'll work for you.

243
19:06.680 --> 19:08.600
Whatever job you give me,

244
19:09.560 --> 19:12.360
I'll do it for the entire month.

245
19:12.440 --> 19:15.480
I'll prove to you that I truly love you.

246
19:16.600 --> 19:18.240
Don't just talk big.

247
19:19.040 --> 19:21.480
If you slack off or miss even a single day of work,

248
19:22.320 --> 19:24.640
you won't receive a single baht of the rest.

249
19:25.520 --> 19:26.440
Alright.

250
19:26.960 --> 19:29.960
I'll prove to you that I'm not a parasite.

251
19:36.520 --> 19:38.240
Which way are the workers' quarters?

252
19:38.320 --> 19:39.440
This way, miss.

253
19:39.520 --> 19:40.440
Let me help you.

254
19:40.520 --> 19:41.600
No one helps her.

255
19:42.120 --> 19:45.280
Hathaya will live in this house as a servant and worker.

256
19:45.360 --> 19:47.040
She has no privileges whatsoever.

257
19:49.560 --> 19:51.920
And if anyone helps this woman,

258
19:52.000 --> 19:53.400
I'll fire them immediately.

259
20:18.720 --> 20:20.000
Grandpa,

260
20:20.760 --> 20:22.960
did you let Hathaya stay

261
20:23.040 --> 20:25.920
because she's your own flesh and blood?

262
20:26.520 --> 20:27.840
At the very least,

263
20:27.920 --> 20:30.480
I can do this for my son.

264
20:30.560 --> 20:31.640
For Burapha.

265
20:35.800 --> 20:37.280
Father,

266
20:37.360 --> 20:39.080
if you want to help her,

267
20:39.160 --> 20:41.280
just give her the money and throw her out.

268
20:41.800 --> 20:44.760
She has no right to demand anything from us anyway.

269
20:45.360 --> 20:47.680
I can see the same arrogance and insolence in her

270
20:48.520 --> 20:49.960
that her mother had.

271
20:55.360 --> 20:57.680
I'm going to teach her pain and suffering

272
20:57.760 --> 20:59.880
far worse than anything her mother ever put me through.

273
21:08.520 --> 21:10.280
I don't agree with this at all.

274
21:11.280 --> 21:13.440
Bringing a poisonous snake this close to us?

275
21:13.520 --> 21:15.320
One day, it's going bite.

276
21:17.160 --> 21:19.720
Fine. I'll go throw her out myself.

277
21:20.320 --> 21:21.680
Don't, Mom.

278
21:23.640 --> 21:25.200
After all,

279
21:25.840 --> 21:27.640
Hathaya is still my sister.

280
21:42.120 --> 21:43.120
This is the room.

281
21:43.200 --> 21:44.160
All right.

282
21:55.280 --> 21:56.600
Thank you, Aunt Ann.

283
21:59.000 --> 22:01.280
Workers' rooms are pretty basic.

284
22:01.800 --> 22:04.240
There aren't many comforts here.

285
22:04.320 --> 22:05.680
Will you be alright?

286
22:06.360 --> 22:08.200
I'll be fine, Aunt Ann.

287
22:08.280 --> 22:11.560
When I lived in the countryside, things were much harder than this.

288
22:11.640 --> 22:13.960
I feel so sorry for you.

289
22:14.720 --> 22:17.680
It's okay, Aunt Ann. I really can manage.

290
22:18.200 --> 22:19.480
And

291
22:19.560 --> 22:22.400
I think you should stop being so polite to me.

292
22:22.480 --> 22:24.400
Aunt Liu and Grandpa might not like it.

293
22:25.000 --> 22:26.880
But I love you.

294
22:27.400 --> 22:29.720
I raised you ever since you were little.

295
22:31.760 --> 22:34.720
Still, when they're around,

296
22:34.800 --> 22:36.480
I'll be careful about what I say to you.

297
22:37.080 --> 22:39.280
Wait here for a moment.

298
22:39.360 --> 22:41.560
I'll go get you some necessities.

299
22:41.640 --> 22:43.160
Thank you, Aunt Ann.

300
23:06.400 --> 23:07.960
Aunt Ann, are you back already?

301
23:09.200 --> 23:10.200
Chaya.

302
23:11.240 --> 23:13.400
Hathaya,

303
23:14.120 --> 23:16.240
come with me.

304
23:16.760 --> 23:18.320
I'll go tell Grandpa

305
23:18.400 --> 23:21.840
to move my beloved big sister into the main house.

306
23:22.520 --> 23:23.960
And if Grandpa refuses,

307
23:24.800 --> 23:26.680
then I'll move in here with you instead.

308
23:28.320 --> 23:31.040
Chaya, it's okay.

309
23:32.200 --> 23:33.400
I can stay here.

310
23:34.600 --> 23:37.200
-But-- -I understand how Grandpa feels.

311
23:38.440 --> 23:41.160
My mom hurt him deeply.

312
23:42.400 --> 23:45.880
And your dad died

313
23:45.960 --> 23:47.480
because of us.

314
23:49.280 --> 23:50.880
Please forgive me, Chaya.

315
24:01.200 --> 24:02.440
It's okay.

316
24:03.520 --> 24:05.400
That happened a long time ago.

317
24:06.520 --> 24:09.200
I've never been angry with you, Hathaya.

318
24:13.320 --> 24:16.600
The kinder you are to me, the guiltier I feel.

319
24:18.600 --> 24:20.280
I'm willing to do anything

320
24:21.240 --> 24:24.000
to make up for my mom's mistakes.

321
24:24.600 --> 24:26.160
I'll prove to everyone

322
24:26.240 --> 24:28.200
that I came here because of love.

323
24:28.720 --> 24:30.920
I'm not here because I want anything from Grandpa.

324
24:31.960 --> 24:35.520
Thank you so much for understanding me, Chaya.

325
24:40.160 --> 24:41.880
We're sisters after all.

326
24:53.480 --> 24:54.720
-Chamoi. -Ma'am.

327
24:54.800 --> 24:56.000
Wait.

328
24:57.760 --> 24:59.800
Those belong to Chayanee.

329
24:59.880 --> 25:01.800
Those belong to my girl. Are you stealing them?

330
25:01.880 --> 25:02.760
Yes.

331
25:04.240 --> 25:05.920
No, no. I mean no!

332
25:06.000 --> 25:08.000
Of course not!

333
25:08.080 --> 25:10.840
I can see you carrying my daughter's things out with my own eyes.

334
25:11.680 --> 25:12.880
Madam.

335
25:13.400 --> 25:14.600
I swear!

336
25:14.680 --> 25:18.200
Buddha, Dharma, Sangha. May lightning strike your house if I'm lying!

337
25:18.280 --> 25:19.640
I didn't steal anything.

338
25:19.720 --> 25:22.960
I told Aunt Chamoi to take those things to Hathaya.

339
25:23.880 --> 25:24.960
Go ahead.

340
25:25.040 --> 25:26.160
Yes, miss.

341
25:32.880 --> 25:34.480
Why are you helping her?

342
25:35.240 --> 25:36.800
If she gets too comfortable here,

343
25:36.880 --> 25:39.120
she'll cling to Grandpa for the rest of her life.

344
25:40.840 --> 25:41.880
Listen to me.

345
25:42.960 --> 25:44.560
If she weren't here,

346
25:45.080 --> 25:48.280
all of Grandpa's inheritance would belong to you.

347
25:48.840 --> 25:52.520
Are you going to let some selfish woman come and take your inheritance away?

348
25:55.160 --> 25:56.320
Mom.

349
25:56.920 --> 25:58.280
What belongs to me stays mine.

350
25:58.960 --> 26:00.560
I won't let anyone take it from me.

351
26:02.320 --> 26:05.840
Then why are you being nice to her? I don't understand.

352
26:09.240 --> 26:11.040
I'm going to make her trust me.

353
26:12.400 --> 26:15.120
I'll play the part of the sweet little angel.

354
26:16.000 --> 26:17.400
And when the time comes,

355
26:18.320 --> 26:20.200
I'll drag her straight down to hell.

356
26:27.680 --> 26:30.040
I waited for Dad to come home.

357
26:34.400 --> 26:36.960
But they took him away from me.

358
26:51.640 --> 26:53.440
They're going to pay

359
26:54.920 --> 26:56.560
for what they did to our family.

360
27:37.200 --> 27:39.440
How are things over there? Are they giving you the money?

361
27:40.040 --> 27:41.960
Grandpa is giving me 500,000 baht.

362
27:42.040 --> 27:44.040
Why did you only ask for that much?

363
27:44.120 --> 27:46.680
Why didn't you ask for ten or 20 million?

364
27:47.280 --> 27:48.200
Mom.

365
27:48.720 --> 27:50.960
You already stole so much money and jewelry from them.

366
27:51.800 --> 27:53.360
I don't want to bother Grandpa anymore.

367
27:53.440 --> 27:57.560
The only reason I asked him for money is so you can pay off your debt

368
27:57.640 --> 27:59.120
and pay for Grandma's treatment.

369
28:00.160 --> 28:01.400
Fine.

370
28:01.480 --> 28:04.560
And don't tell them where I am,

371
28:04.640 --> 28:06.280
or they'll call the police on me.

372
28:07.640 --> 28:08.560
Okay.

373
28:10.000 --> 28:12.320
Mom. How's Grandma?

374
28:14.560 --> 28:16.320
She's fine now.

375
28:16.400 --> 28:19.120
The doctor says she can leave the hospital in a few days.

376
28:19.960 --> 28:23.240
Listen, tomorrow you need to hurry up and get that money from them.

377
28:23.320 --> 28:25.560
Otherwise, they're really going to kill me.

378
28:29.080 --> 28:30.120
Alright.

379
28:31.120 --> 28:35.040
Once Grandpa transfers the money, I'll send it to you.

380
28:35.840 --> 28:37.200
Make sure to pay off the debt.

381
28:37.280 --> 28:39.560
Yeah, I know.

382
28:41.080 --> 28:43.400
How are you doing over there?

383
28:43.480 --> 28:44.960
They're treating you well, right?

384
28:54.200 --> 28:55.240
Well…

385
28:58.360 --> 29:00.240
Everyone here

386
29:00.320 --> 29:04.120
was so excited and happy that I came back.

387
29:06.000 --> 29:08.000
Grandpa hugged me really tight.

388
29:09.800 --> 29:11.840
He told me how much he missed me.

389
29:15.520 --> 29:16.760
And…

390
29:17.720 --> 29:19.080
your father?

391
29:19.640 --> 29:21.440
Did he ask about me?

392
29:27.560 --> 29:29.120
Dad is dead, Mom.

393
29:36.640 --> 29:38.040
Dad and Uncle Thot

394
29:38.800 --> 29:41.680
died in an accident that same day.

395
29:49.040 --> 29:51.080
I guess this was all the time we had.

396
29:52.280 --> 29:54.920
Take care of yourself.

397
29:56.320 --> 29:57.560
Okay, Mom.

398
30:26.240 --> 30:27.360
Grandma.

399
30:32.560 --> 30:36.480
I'll endure this and keep working until the end of the month.

400
30:36.560 --> 30:38.400
I'll do my very best.

401
30:39.360 --> 30:41.960
I'll bring the money back for your treatment.

402
31:07.880 --> 31:09.160
I'll help Father.

403
31:09.800 --> 31:11.080
Father.

404
31:13.280 --> 31:16.120
I'm feeling better now. There's no need to worry.

405
31:19.960 --> 31:22.120
That arrogant woman left already, didn't she?

406
31:26.120 --> 31:28.840
She thought she could come back and live comfortably here,

407
31:29.640 --> 31:31.320
but after just one night

408
31:32.600 --> 31:35.200
in the workers' quarters, she packed up and ran away.

409
31:37.480 --> 31:39.120
Who are you talking about, Grandpa?

410
31:46.960 --> 31:49.520
I hired you to work. Why are you late?

411
31:50.280 --> 31:54.280
I'm not late, Grandpa. I know what time you eat,

412
31:54.360 --> 31:56.640
so I came to prepare some hot rice porridge for you.

413
31:57.160 --> 31:59.080
You don't have to do that.

414
31:59.160 --> 32:01.840
Chamoi already prepared Father's food.

415
32:02.440 --> 32:05.600
Aunt Liu, Grandpa needs to watch his diet.

416
32:05.680 --> 32:08.320
He needs less salt, less fat, and less strongly seasoned food.

417
32:08.400 --> 32:10.520
Aunt Chamoi used minced pork belly

418
32:10.600 --> 32:13.000
with fish sauce, sugar, and seasoning sauce.

419
32:13.080 --> 32:17.360
I used lean pork and low-sodium seasoning sauce instead.

420
32:17.440 --> 32:20.400
And this is vegetable juice, Grandpa. It'll give you more fiber.

421
32:20.480 --> 32:23.400
I also don't recommend drinking sweet fruit juice

422
32:23.480 --> 32:26.720
because it contains a lot of sugar, which can affect your circulation.

423
32:27.240 --> 32:28.680
Enjoy your meal, Grandpa.

424
32:32.520 --> 32:34.600
Go make me another bowl. I'll wait.

425
32:34.680 --> 32:36.000
Yes, sir.

426
32:44.640 --> 32:46.320
Grandpa,

427
32:46.400 --> 32:48.920
Hathaya made this especially for you.

428
32:49.000 --> 32:52.800
You need to eat on time so you can take your medicine.

429
32:56.680 --> 32:59.080
I already prepared your after-meal medicine too.

430
33:00.440 --> 33:01.480
Please.

431
33:07.920 --> 33:09.440
If you're done, then go.

432
33:10.680 --> 33:12.520
There's plenty of work for you to do.

433
33:12.600 --> 33:14.920
Standing around here is irritating me so much,

434
33:15.760 --> 33:16.800
I can't even eat.

435
33:25.960 --> 33:29.640
Hathaya, go get some rest. I'll take care of Grandpa here.

436
33:39.800 --> 33:41.560
Come on, Grandpa. Eat.

437
33:44.200 --> 33:45.760
Let me help you.

438
33:45.840 --> 33:46.880
Chayanee.

439
34:47.280 --> 34:49.679
Here, miss. Let me do it.

440
34:49.760 --> 34:51.239
It's okay.

441
34:52.320 --> 34:53.440
I'll help.

442
34:54.159 --> 34:55.159
You don't have to.

443
34:55.760 --> 34:57.600
You've been up since early this morning,

444
34:57.680 --> 35:00.640
and you already cooked for Master.

445
35:00.720 --> 35:01.920
Go get some rest.

446
35:03.560 --> 35:04.600
You cannot rest.

447
35:05.600 --> 35:07.880
Madam ordered her to work.

448
35:07.960 --> 35:10.240
Chamoi, have you forgotten?

449
35:10.320 --> 35:13.600
This is Miss Hathaya. She's one of our employers.

450
35:13.680 --> 35:17.440
I don't have Alzheimer's. That was in the past.

451
35:17.520 --> 35:20.880
The Lord Buddha taught us

452
35:20.960 --> 35:22.520
not to cling to the past,

453
35:22.600 --> 35:26.360
not to worry about the future,

454
35:26.440 --> 35:29.200
but to live in the present.

455
35:29.280 --> 35:31.360
And right now,

456
35:31.440 --> 35:34.240
your precious Miss Hathaya is a servant.

457
35:34.320 --> 35:35.760
Madam specifically

458
35:35.840 --> 35:38.320
ordered me

459
35:38.400 --> 35:39.920
to keep an eye on her.

460
35:40.000 --> 35:42.800
I, Chamoi Sri,

461
35:42.880 --> 35:44.840
the loyal servant,

462
35:44.920 --> 35:47.560
must follow Madam's orders to the letter!

463
35:48.560 --> 35:50.880
You're nothing but a shameless suck-up.

464
35:50.960 --> 35:53.440
Whatever the master says, the servant parrots.

465
35:53.520 --> 35:55.600
You keep pointing your finger in my face,

466
35:55.680 --> 35:56.880
-and I'm gonna slap you! -Go ahead!

467
35:56.960 --> 35:58.360
Enough already.

468
35:58.440 --> 36:01.080
Stop!

469
36:01.160 --> 36:03.080
Don't fight because of me.

470
36:03.160 --> 36:04.160
I'll wash them myself.

471
36:04.240 --> 36:09.080
Applause, please! You are amazing.

472
36:11.360 --> 36:12.760
What is this?

473
36:13.800 --> 36:16.360
I washed these yesterday.

474
36:17.560 --> 36:18.800
Well, Madam said they weren't clean.

475
36:20.080 --> 36:21.400
And they stink.

476
36:21.480 --> 36:24.200
So she ordered everything to be washed again.

477
36:26.040 --> 36:27.200
Just do it.

478
36:27.280 --> 36:31.560
Madam said they have to be washed by hand until they're spotless.

479
36:32.360 --> 36:36.080
And don't let me catch you helping her.

480
36:36.160 --> 36:38.920
I'll tell Master and have you thrown out.

481
36:41.120 --> 36:43.480
Go on. Don't you have anything else to do?

482
36:47.440 --> 36:48.280
Shoo!

483
36:58.960 --> 37:00.840
Madam.

484
37:00.920 --> 37:02.720
-What? -Madam.

485
37:02.800 --> 37:05.800
Madam, I gave her the full package.

486
37:05.880 --> 37:08.120
I made her wash all the clothes by hand,

487
37:08.200 --> 37:10.000
sweep and mop the floors, hang up the laundry,

488
37:10.080 --> 37:11.320
clean the whole house.

489
37:11.400 --> 37:15.040
Now she's ironing until her hands are practically twisted.

490
37:15.800 --> 37:17.640
Good.

491
37:17.720 --> 37:19.440
Do whatever it takes

492
37:19.520 --> 37:22.480
to make her leave this house as soon as possible.

493
37:22.560 --> 37:24.240
I'll reward you handsomely.

494
37:24.320 --> 37:26.120
Madam,

495
37:26.200 --> 37:29.520
I already gave her the full package.

496
37:29.600 --> 37:31.840
So, I was thinking,

497
37:31.920 --> 37:34.080
maybe a little something for my trouble?

498
37:36.480 --> 37:38.360
-Here. -Wow!

499
37:39.080 --> 37:39.920
Twenty baht?

500
37:40.520 --> 37:43.040
What? Is that too little for you?

501
37:44.040 --> 37:46.240
-You don't want it? -Madam,

502
37:46.320 --> 37:49.960
seeing this makes my heart so full.

503
37:51.920 --> 37:53.880
I'm sleepy. I'm going to bed.

504
37:57.360 --> 38:00.520
She's a millionaire and tips me 20 baht.

505
38:00.600 --> 38:02.680
What a headache.

506
38:57.040 --> 38:59.040
It's bedtime, Daddy's good girl.

507
40:06.520 --> 40:08.000
Dad.

508
40:13.640 --> 40:15.160
I'm sorry.

509
40:17.960 --> 40:21.360
I'm sorry I made you leave us so soon.

510
40:31.680 --> 40:33.120
It wasn't your fault, sweetheart.

511
40:34.840 --> 40:36.600
Everything that happened.

512
40:37.520 --> 40:40.560
We can't turn back time to change it

513
40:40.640 --> 40:41.960
or fix it.

514
40:43.240 --> 40:44.880
But we can decide what to do now.

515
40:46.120 --> 40:47.840
When I came back here,

516
40:49.200 --> 40:53.120
I never imagined Grandpa would be this angry with me and hate me this much.

517
40:54.480 --> 40:57.120
Do you love Grandpa?

518
41:00.080 --> 41:02.360
I love him very much.

519
41:04.880 --> 41:06.800
Then show him

520
41:06.880 --> 41:09.960
how much you love him.

521
41:16.000 --> 41:18.080
Don't worry about what anyone else says.

522
41:18.880 --> 41:24.080
In your heart, you know what you're doing and why.

523
41:35.240 --> 41:36.720
Dad.

524
41:38.320 --> 41:39.880
I won't give up.

525
42:10.160 --> 42:11.640
My bedroom.

526
42:19.360 --> 42:20.440
Don't go in.

527
42:27.840 --> 42:32.600
I just wanted to see my old room.

528
42:34.200 --> 42:35.680
That is not your room.

529
42:36.640 --> 42:38.560
And I threw away everything that was in it.

530
42:40.720 --> 42:44.480
When I was little, you bought me a blanket.

531
42:44.560 --> 42:47.000
I wanted to go in and get that old ragged blanket.

532
42:47.680 --> 42:49.280
I burned it.

533
42:52.600 --> 42:55.600
Why did you come upstairs? Are you here to ask me for the money?

534
42:57.040 --> 42:58.000
No.

535
42:58.960 --> 43:01.320
I'll transfer the first 500,000 to you.

536
43:03.600 --> 43:05.840
But if you don't stay until the end of the month,

537
43:07.560 --> 43:10.520
you won't get a single baht of the rest. Don't forget that condition.

538
43:13.560 --> 43:14.960
And don't come upstairs again.

539
43:15.720 --> 43:18.000
You're a servant. Stay where you belong.

540
43:23.000 --> 43:24.040
Yes.

541
43:25.040 --> 43:26.040
Go.

542
44:21.800 --> 44:22.840
Hello, Mom.

543
44:23.720 --> 44:25.680
I already transferred 500,000 baht to you.

544
44:25.760 --> 44:27.880
Please hurry and pay off the debt

545
44:27.960 --> 44:30.040
before the interest gets even worse.

546
44:30.120 --> 44:34.280
Yeah, I know. I'm not going to gamble with it.

547
44:34.800 --> 44:35.880
Bye.

548
44:35.960 --> 44:37.040
Bye.

549
44:46.920 --> 44:51.080
Like mother, like daughter. You came to bleed me dry.

550
44:52.760 --> 44:55.560
I'll never forgive anyone who was cruel to me.

551
45:02.360 --> 45:04.600
RAMIL

552
45:06.760 --> 45:10.240
Ramil. I need you to do something for me.

553
45:17.760 --> 45:18.600
You!

554
45:18.680 --> 45:21.040
Not "you". My name is Ramil.

555
45:21.120 --> 45:23.840
What the hell are you doing? And how did you get in here?

556
45:23.920 --> 45:25.200
Spare key.

557
45:25.280 --> 45:28.160
Where did you get it? And why did you throw water on me?

558
45:28.240 --> 45:30.200
It's part of my mission.

559
45:30.280 --> 45:33.760
Now get up, take a shower, and get to work.

560
45:33.840 --> 45:36.200
Why should I listen to you?

561
45:36.280 --> 45:37.200
I'm not going.

562
45:42.040 --> 45:44.120
Because it's my order.

563
45:44.800 --> 45:45.640
Grandpa?

564
45:46.480 --> 45:48.120
I haven't been feeling well lately.

565
45:48.840 --> 45:51.600
I need to rest, so I don't have time to go inspect the site.

566
45:52.240 --> 45:54.240
Ramil is my foreman.

567
45:55.720 --> 45:57.600
You'll be his helper.

568
45:57.680 --> 46:00.840
You want me to work with this rude man?

569
46:00.920 --> 46:03.680
He just barged into my room and threw water on me!

570
46:05.000 --> 46:07.160
You think Ramil is rude?

571
46:07.920 --> 46:11.480
You barged into my birthday party without being invited.

572
46:12.560 --> 46:14.200
My party was ruined because of you.

573
46:15.840 --> 46:17.600
Which one of you has worse manners?

574
46:22.320 --> 46:23.880
I'll go take a shower right now.

575
46:26.440 --> 46:28.120
Your tone changed pretty quickly.

576
46:28.200 --> 46:29.840
You've got ten minutes.

577
46:29.920 --> 46:31.320
Ten minutes?!

578
46:31.840 --> 46:33.360
Are you crazy? No way I can make it.

579
46:33.960 --> 46:36.280
Now you've got nine minutes and 55 seconds.

580
46:44.280 --> 46:46.000
You jerk!

581
46:50.440 --> 46:51.480
I like hearing that.

582
46:51.560 --> 46:52.880
Why aren't you in the shower yet?

583
46:52.960 --> 46:55.560
Or do you want me to bathe you myself?

584
47:02.400 --> 47:05.920
Do you really want me to do that, sir? She's your granddaughter.

585
47:06.520 --> 47:08.480
She was out of my life for more than ten years.

586
47:09.520 --> 47:11.520
I have no idea what kind of person she grew up to be

587
47:12.280 --> 47:14.320
or how her mother raised her.

588
47:17.120 --> 47:18.600
But if she wants to stay here,

589
47:19.120 --> 47:20.680
she has to prove to me

590
47:21.600 --> 47:23.560
that she's capable and sincere.

591
47:24.960 --> 47:26.000
Understood.

592
47:26.960 --> 47:28.440
I'll do exactly as you say.

593
47:32.000 --> 47:32.840
Grandpa,

594
47:33.600 --> 47:35.000
I'm ready for work.

595
47:38.400 --> 47:39.480
Go. The truck is waiting.

596
47:46.000 --> 47:46.960
Hathaya.

597
47:48.160 --> 47:49.480
If you can't handle it,

598
47:50.280 --> 47:52.960
have Ramil drive you to the bus station and go back home.

599
47:57.640 --> 47:59.840
See you this evening, Grandpa.

600
48:11.480 --> 48:12.440
CONSTRUCTION PROJECT

601
48:14.320 --> 48:18.080
You're about to learn that a construction worker's life isn't as easy as you think.

602
48:28.920 --> 48:31.360
Wait. What are you doing?

603
48:32.560 --> 48:33.880
Getting in.

604
48:37.160 --> 48:41.000
I shouldn't sit next to a rude driver.

605
48:41.080 --> 48:42.960
The boss should sit in the back.

606
48:44.000 --> 48:44.960
Wait. That's not it.

607
48:45.040 --> 48:47.200
In the truck bed.

608
48:47.280 --> 48:48.200
What?!

609
48:49.800 --> 48:52.240
You expect me to sit in the back of the pickup?

610
48:52.320 --> 48:55.440
By the time we reach the site, I'll be like a dried squid!

611
48:55.520 --> 48:56.680
I can't do that.

612
48:56.760 --> 49:00.760
If you can't handle it, you're more than welcome to sit inside.

613
49:00.840 --> 49:03.040
I'll drive you straight to the bus station.

614
49:21.200 --> 49:23.000
You lunatic!

615
49:23.520 --> 49:26.800
You are mean! Couldn't you see I'd just climbed on?

616
49:27.560 --> 49:28.560
You!

617
49:38.040 --> 49:40.520
I haven't held 500,000 baht in years.

618
49:40.600 --> 49:42.320
My hands are shaking.

619
49:43.400 --> 49:44.360
Let me take another look.

620
50:10.120 --> 50:11.360
Don't you dare!

621
50:12.040 --> 50:15.080
Grandpa sent her to work at the construction site.

622
50:15.160 --> 50:16.880
I love it.

623
50:16.960 --> 50:18.680
Working around construction workers?

624
50:18.760 --> 50:21.440
A few days and she'll probably end up with a husband.

625
50:21.520 --> 50:22.880
Go wash out the cement bucket.

626
50:22.960 --> 50:24.160
NEXT EPISODE

627
50:24.240 --> 50:27.520
If I see even a trace of cement left in it, you don't get to eat.

628
50:27.600 --> 50:29.440
Have you eaten anything yet?

629
50:32.120 --> 50:35.600
How much longer are you going to keep our secret?

630
50:37.240 --> 50:40.880
Everything you've had since childhood is because of me!

631
